                            Built on a container-based application server using
                            Docker and a lightweight, secure WebAssembly (WASM)
                            client runtime, LiveApp lets developers publish apps
                            and games that users can launch in seconds —
                            <strong>no downloads, no updates, no waiting.</strong>
                        </p>

